; Apple simdgroup matrices (KernelContext.simdgroupMatrix*): a Matrix8x8Float value is an MSL
; simdgroup_float8x8; loads read device or threadgroup memory, stores write device memory. Half,
; transposed and mixed fragments: simdgroup-matrix-half.tcir.
